{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34148","headline":"补沈恭子诗 · 陆龟蒙","name":"补沈恭子诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵质贯轩昊，遐年越商周。\n自然失远裔，安得怨寡俦。\n我亦小国胤，易名慙见优。\n虽非放旷怀，雅奉逍遥游。\n携手桂枝下，属词山之幽。\n风雨一以过，林麓飒然秋。\n落日倚石壁，天寒登古丘。\n荒泉已无夕，败叶翳不流。\n乱翠缺月隐，衰红清露愁。\n览物性未逸，反爲情所囚。\n异才偶绝境，佳藻穷冥搜。\n虚倾寂寞音，敢作杂佩酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}